  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nHumans once wielded formidable magical power. But with over 7 billion of us on the planet now, Mana has spread far too thinly to have any effect. When hostile aliens reduce humanity to a mere fraction, the survivors discover an old power has begun to reawaken once again. Being that this power can be good or evil, mana can be extremely dangerous when it falls into the wrong hands.",
